  "notes": [
    "Placements extracted from supplier AP214 assembly, with matrix coefficients rounded to 12 decimal places.",
    "Module solid groups identify external housing, output flange and attached output fasteners, not internal drive construction.",
    "J1 and J2 have the output flange upstream; positive model coordinates describe downstream-body motion, not vendor motor command signs.",
    "Gear ratios, brake/encoder options, joint limits, cable flex loops and motor command signs remain uncommissioned.",
    "Engineering wrist revision, not an unchanged supplier assembly. J4/J5/J6 use the supplier 80T chain; the matched hollow forearm is shortened 189 mm with preserved supplier end sections and a 40 mm hollow transition loft, retaining both end interfaces. Shoulder remains original 110T until a suitable faster drive is selected."
